WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.716
"NeuPL is validated across three domains chosen to
span the difficulty spectrum.

00:00:03.796 --> 00:00:07.513
Rock-paper-scissors is the classic purely cyclic
normal-form game,

00:00:07.593 --> 00:00:11.309
where the learned population can be visualized
directly on the strategy simplex.

00:00:11.389 --> 00:00:15.105
Running-with-scissors lifts this into a spatiotemporal,

00:00:15.185 --> 00:00:18.902
partially observed setting: players move on a grid,
collect rock, paper,

00:00:18.982 --> 00:00:22.698
and scissors resources,

00:00:22.778 --> 00:00:26.495
and must infer a hidden opponent inventory from a
narrow first-person view.

00:00:26.575 --> 00:00:30.291
Finally,

00:00:30.371 --> 00:00:34.087
MuJoCo Football is a large-scale Game-of-Skills
where two-versus-two teams must simultaneously

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:37.884
master continuous motor control and coordinated team play,

00:00:37.964 --> 00:00:41.680
a regime where handcrafted PSRO truncation is
especially fragile."
